# headwear/cloth/turban: the Turban (OUTER, P2b wave 2): a long cloth wound round the head in lit bands that cross at the front,
# a brass brooch where they cross, the last wrap lit over the brow; the hair is wound in (mask: 18-20 px over the head),
# long lengths below it still show. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear turban
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend Q head 0
legend R head 1
legend S head 2
legend T head 3
legend U head 4

# (P5b SIG B) begin dune-turban: the Dune T1-T2 turban: wound two rows lower, its teal brow wraps and its tail (STYLE_P5B 4-5, area B)
legend 0 plume 0
legend 1 plume 1
legend 2 plume 2
legend 3 plume 3
legend 4 plume 4
view D key rest when sighelm-dune
